# An allowlist, not a denylist: ignore the whole root, then let the site back in.
#
# Everything else in this repo is development material -- the Blender sources and
# their export scripts, the local server, the screenshot tool, the README, and a
# 15.8 MB creek.blend. None of it is needed to run the page, and without this it
# would all be uploaded and publicly fetchable at /blender/creek.blend and friends.
#
# models/ is the one exception, and it is not an exception to the rule: the
# models are the site, the same way src/ and assets/ are. A guest's folder holds
# its spec, its behaviour and its glTF, and all three ship.
#
# vercel.json has to be named explicitly. The `/*` below would otherwise take the
# config with it, and the allowlist has to follow the same shape as the ignore.
/*
!index.html
!src
!assets
!models
!package.json
!vercel.json
